# Spotify — powers the now-playing display ONLY (track/art/progress).
# It does NOT drive the visualizer's reactivity (that comes from Tab/System capture).
#
# Setup:
#   1. Create an app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
#   2. Add this exact Redirect URI in the app settings:  http://127.0.0.1:5173
#      (Spotify rejects http://localhost — loopback must be the 127.0.0.1 literal.)
#   3. Enable the "Web API". Under User Management, add your own Spotify account.
#   4. Copy this file to `.env.local`, paste your Client ID below, restart `npm run dev`,
#      and open the app at http://127.0.0.1:5173 so the redirect matches.

VITE_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_SPOTIFY_REDIRECT_URI=http://127.0.0.1:5173
